    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Castle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be a fun Halloween adventure \u2014just you and your friends exploring an old, abandoned castle at night. But some places were never meant to be found\u2026 and this is one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get separated, and things quickly take a dark turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped. And you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal creatures are hiding in the shadows, and an unseen presence watches your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you search for your missing friends, you\u2019ll uncover a hidden history of human experimentation, twisted rituals, and supernatural horrors buried deep within the walls. Will you be able to find your friends and escape with them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Forbidden is a single-player horror experience focused on stealth, exploration, and puzzle-solving \u2014with a touch of parkour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only tool is a malfunctioning flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you make your way through the castle, you\u2019ll explore surreal rooms, solve strange environmental puzzles, uncover hidden secrets, and avoid deadly traps. Each area introduces new threats, mechanics, and twisted environments as the castle transforms around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real danger is sound. Every movement creates echoes. A live sound gauge tracks how much noise you\u2019re making (in-game). Be too loud, and the Guard will come hunting. If the gauge fills up completely, there won\u2019t be time to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if he finds you\u2026 it\u2019s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more dangerous are the creatures lurking in the dark. Born of the castle\u2019s experiments, they cannot be fought. Your only hope is to stay quiet and pray they pass you by.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey leads to a final decision \u2014one that will decide your survival and reveal the castle\u2019s darkest secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you face this moment will shape the ending you get. Will you escape\u2026 or become part of the horror?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Castle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be a fun Halloween adventure \u2014just you and your friends exploring an old, abandoned castle at night. But some places were never meant to be found\u2026 and this is one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get separated, and things quickly take a dark turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped. And you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal creatures are hiding in the shadows, and an unseen presence watches your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you search for your missing friends, you\u2019ll uncover a hidden history of human experimentation, twisted rituals, and supernatural horrors buried deep within the walls. Will you be able to find your friends and escape with them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Forbidden is a single-player horror experience focused on stealth, exploration, and puzzle-solving \u2014with a touch of parkour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only tool is a malfunctioning flashlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you make your way through the castle, you\u2019ll explore surreal rooms, solve strange environmental puzzles, uncover hidden secrets, and avoid deadly traps. Each area introduces new threats, mechanics, and twisted environments as the castle transforms around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real danger is sound. Every movement creates echoes. A live sound gauge tracks how much noise you\u2019re making (in-game). Be too loud, and the Guard will come hunting. If the gauge fills up completely, there won\u2019t be time to hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if he finds you\u2026 it\u2019s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more dangerous are the creatures lurking in the dark. Born of the castle\u2019s experiments, they cannot be fought. Your only hope is to stay quiet and pray they pass you by.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey leads to a final decision \u2014one that will decide your survival and reveal the castle\u2019s darkest secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you face this moment will shape the ending you get. Will you escape\u2026 or become part of the horror?</p>",
